{"id":"2d49b9fae2b96976","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-clark-equational-theory.md","title":"df Clark equational theory","display":"df Clark equational theory","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-clark-equational-theory","aliases":["72-df-clark-equational-theory"],"display":"df Clark equational theory","depends_on":["[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §2.5 (E1), (E2) and DCA, print648–649/PDF660–661","verification_status":"source-definition-checked; explicit substitution encoding checked","proof_status":"definition-well-defined; no unification algorithm or equality-completeness theorem asserted","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_expansion":"统一复用有限支持代入和 MGU，保留 CET 的原签名适配器"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-clark-equational-theory"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-clark-equational-theory</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df Clark equational theory"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §2.5 (E1), (E2) and DCA, print648–649/PDF660–661"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked; explicit substitution encoding checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined; no unification algorithm or equality-completeness theorem asserted"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_expansion","html":"统一复用有限支持代入和 MGU，保留 CET 的原签名适配器"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\">\\(V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> 和四值结构取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"40bb12b12b7a39e7\" href=\"?note=40bb12b12b7a39e7\" title=\"72-df-four-valued-structure\">72-df-four-valued-structure</a> 的接口；语法等号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"=\">\\(=\\)</span> 与对象公式构造子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\doteq\">\\(\\doteq\\)</span> 分开。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle\">\\(E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i&lt;n\\rangle\\)</span> 为有限项对序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma\\)</span>。有限合取和析取使用下式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma,\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的右结合构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\vec B\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\sigma,\\theta,\\tau\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\sigma\">\\(t\\sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ed15cbe9da0035aa\" href=\"?note=ed15cbe9da0035aa\" title=\"72-df-logic-program-substitution\">72-df-logic-program-substitution</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU}\">\\(\\operatorname{Unif},\\operatorname{MGU}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03ecee8b72b25180\" href=\"?note=03ecee8b72b25180\" title=\"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier\">72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier</a>；合成先施 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> 后施 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 以变量编号递增的顺序作全称闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)\">\\(\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)\\)</span> 只用于该签名的四值结构。以下 DCA 分支仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\cup F\">\\(C\\cup F\\)</span> 有限时定义，枚举及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_C,m_F,x,\\vec y_j\">\\(k_C,m_F,x,\\vec y_j\\)</span> 只用于该分支；在此固定单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu:C\\cup F\\hookrightarrow\\omega\">\\(\\nu:C\\cup F\\hookrightarrow\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle c_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k_C}\">\\(\\langle c_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k_C}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle f_j\\rangle_{j&lt;m_F}\">\\(\\langle f_j\\rangle_{j&lt;m_F}\\)</span> 分别为按 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 严格递增排列的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,F\">\\(C,F\\)</span> 的全枚举。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,\\vec y_j\">\\(x,\\vec y_j\\)</span> 由下式确定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k_C=|C|,m_F=|F|\">\\(k_C=|C|,m_F=|F|\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DCA}_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathsf{DCA}_\\Sigma\\)</span> 的记号省略固定参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>。长度为零的量词前缀不添加量词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a_F(f_j)=0\">\\(a_F(f_j)=0\\)</span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f_j(\\langle\\rangle)\">\\(f_j(\\langle\\rangle)\\)</span> 仍为合法零元函数项。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\top,&amp;\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;:=A,&amp;\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;:=A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;:=A\\land\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\vec B)&amp;\n&amp;\\quad(0&lt;|\\vec B|),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;:=A\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\vec B)&amp;\n&amp;\\quad(0&lt;|\\vec B|).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\top,&amp;\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle\\rangle)&amp;:=\\bot,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;:=A,&amp;\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle)&amp;:=A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;:=A\\land\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\vec B)&amp;\n&amp;\\quad(0&lt;|\\vec B|),\\\\\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle A\\rangle^\\frown\\vec B)&amp;:=A\\lor\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\vec B)&amp;\n&amp;\\quad(0&lt;|\\vec B|).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)&amp;:=\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle a_i\\doteq b_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)&amp;:=\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\operatorname{ran}(E),\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{MGU}(\\operatorname{ran}(E),\\theta),\\\\\n\\theta\\tau&amp;:=\\theta\\star\\tau,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=(\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)\\times\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma))^{&lt;\\omega},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)&amp;:=\\operatorname{And}_\\Sigma(\\langle a_i\\doteq b_i\\rangle_{i&lt;n}),\\\\\n\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)&amp;:=\\{\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_\\Sigma:\\operatorname{Unif}(\\operatorname{ran}(E),\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{MGU}(\\operatorname{ran}(E),\\theta),\\\\\n\\theta\\tau&amp;:=\\theta\\star\\tau,\\\\\n\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(A)&amp;:=\\forall v_{i_0}\\cdots\\forall v_{i_{k-1}}A\n\\quad(\\operatorname{FV}_{72}(A)=\\{v_{i_j}:j&lt;k\\},\\ i_0&lt;\\cdots&lt;i_{k-1}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)):E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}((\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E))\\lor(c\\doteq d)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma},\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\forall s\\in D^V\\ (⟦ B⟧_{M,s}=\\mathsf t),\\\\\nx&amp;:=v_0,\\qquad y_{j,l}:=v_{1+\\sum_{h&lt;j}a_F(f_h)+l}\\quad(j&lt;m_F,\\ l&lt;a_F(f_j)),\\\\\n\\vec y_j&amp;:=\\langle y_{j,l}\\rangle_{l&lt;a_F(f_j)},\\\\\n\\mathsf{DCA}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\forall x\\left[\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle x\\doteq c_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k_C})\\lor\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\exists y_{j,0}\\cdots\\exists y_{j,a_F(f_j)-1}\\,(x\\doteq f_j(\\vec y_j))\n\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_F}\\right)\\right]\\quad(|C\\cup F|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}(\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E)):E\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\mathsf{Unif}_{\\Sigma}(E)=\\varnothing\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\cup\\{\\operatorname{ucl}_{\\Sigma}((\\sim\\operatorname{EqForm}(E))\\lor(c\\doteq d)):\nE\\in\\mathsf{EqList}_{\\Sigma},\\ c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma),\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{42mm}\\exists\\theta\\in\\mathsf{Sub}_{\\Sigma}\\ (\\operatorname{MGU}_{\\Sigma}(E,\\theta)\\land c\\theta=d\\theta)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{EqBase}_{\\Sigma}(M)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall B\\in\\mathsf{CET}_{\\Sigma}\\ \\forall s\\in D^V\\ (⟦ B⟧_{M,s}=\\mathsf t),\\\\\nx&amp;:=v_0,\\qquad y_{j,l}:=v_{1+\\sum_{h&lt;j}a_F(f_h)+l}\\quad(j&lt;m_F,\\ l&lt;a_F(f_j)),\\\\\n\\vec y_j&amp;:=\\langle y_{j,l}\\rangle_{l&lt;a_F(f_j)},\\\\\n\\mathsf{DCA}_{\\Sigma}&amp;:=\\forall x\\left[\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma(\\langle x\\doteq c_i\\rangle_{i&lt;k_C})\\lor\n\\operatorname{Or}_\\Sigma\\left(\\left\\langle\n\\exists y_{j,0}\\cdots\\exists y_{j,a_F(f_j)-1}\\,(x\\doteq f_j(\\vec y_j))\n\\right\\rangle_{j&lt;m_F}\\right)\\right]\\quad(|C\\cup F|&lt;\\omega).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源是 IX §2.5 的两个公理模式及有限语言的域闭包公理。PDF660 的页图核对了 E1/E2 的方向、最一般合一子条件；DCA 的有限析取按 PDF661 的原式展开常元分支。所有表达式先是语法对象，闭包后的 CET 是纯等式公式的集合；它不含关系符号的合同公理。</p>\n<p>代换的项递归有唯一输出；有限支撑代换的合成仍有限支撑。MGU 这里只是明确定义的谓词，不把合一算法、MGU 的一般存在性或 Theorem 2.5.1 的等式完备性冒充本节点已经证明的结论。等式解释只取共同域、常元和函数解释，因此 EqBase 在同基底的关系解释间不变。Herbrand 基底满足这些公理；任意身份等号的基底未必满足，例如不同常元可被解释成同一元素。</p>\n<p>本轮把稳定复用的代入及最一般统一子拆为书内明确接口；本节点继续提供原来的有限方程表版本。对 E 取 ran 只去掉顺序与重复，不改变统一条件；因此旧的 UnifΣ、MGUΣ、CET、EqBase 与 DCA 调用签名及含义保持。没有建立双向定义依赖。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-four-valued-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-logic-program-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"ed15cbe9da0035aa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-logic-program-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier","status":"resolved","id":"03ecee8b72b25180","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-four-valued-structure","status":"resolved","id":"40bb12b12b7a39e7","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$、$V=\\mathrm{Var}_S=\\{v_i:i\\in\\omega\\}$、$\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$ 和四值结构取 [[72-df-four-valued-structure]] 的接口；语法等号 $=$ 与对象公式构造子 $\\doteq$ 分开。$n\\in\\omega$，$E=\\langle(a_i,b_i):i<n\\rangle$ 为有限项对序列；$c,d\\in\\mathrm{Trm}_S(\\Sigma)$，$A\\in\\mathsf{LPFml}_\\Sigma$。有限合取